://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101066#issuecomment-2569429058","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101066","id":2569429058,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZJmBC","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T15:38:39Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T15:44:25Z","body":"This PR makes the editor fonts appear bigger.\r\nBefore:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d895744-bcd0-43d2-aa3d-e980e30a1ee8)\r\nAfter:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1730587c-a366-49f8-a33a-0eed7308fcba)\r\nNot sure which one is more correct.\r\n\r\nThe fix makes sense though, not sure why this check even existed. It was added back in #41100 CC @bruvzg \r\n\r\nEDIT:\r\nThe behavior is documented:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_theme.html#class-theme-method-has-font\r\nso the change might be wrong.\r\n\r\nEDIT2:\r\n> Related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/84993\r\n\r\nIt would effectively close this issue, because the original problem is \"fixed\" here.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569429058/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569457490","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101066#issuecomment-2569457490","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101066","id":2569457490,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZJs9S","user":{"login":"dagarsar","id":32908423,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTA4NDIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32908423?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar","html_url":"https://github.com/dagarsar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T15:57:30Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T16:05:18Z","body":"I think the inheritance problem in #80731 still remains and should be fixed here. Maybe the ```has_font``` method in the Control class should make that check on its own, in order to preserve the behaviour?\r\n\r\n> This PR makes the editor fonts appear bigger. \r\n\r\nThis is probably a side effect of inheritance becoming functional, and the fix should be in the editor theme, it's my guess.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569457490/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569478675","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101066#issuecomment-2569478675","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101066","id":2569478675,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZJyIT","user":{"login":"dagarsar","id":32908423,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTA4NDIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32908423?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar","html_url":"https://github.com/dagarsar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T16:12:24Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T16:12:24Z","body":"> This will break editor UI.\r\n> `has_font`/`has_font_size` almost always return `true` since both are always set in any normal conditions, so it is correct behavior.\r\n\r\nThen, should I change the ```has_theme_item``` method in ```Theme``` and make it call a new method that only checks if there is a specifically defined font / font size in this theme type? \r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569478675/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569491596","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101066#issuecomment-2569491596","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101066","id":2569491596,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZJ1SM","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T16:22:30Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T16:22:30Z","body":"> Then, should I change the has_theme_item method in Theme and make it call a new method that only checks if there is a specifically defined font / font size in this theme type?\r\n\r\nThis will have the same effect. The inheritance issue likely related to the `default_font`/`default_font_size` being set for a non-default theme, not in a `has_` function behavior.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569491596/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569503052","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101066#issuecomment-2569503052","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101066","id":2569503052,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZJ4FM","user":{"login":"dagarsar","id":32908423,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTA4NDIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32908423?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar","html_url":"https://github.com/dagarsar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T16:30:51Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T16:33:08Z","body":"The problem in the inheritance occurs because in `Control`'s `get_theme_font` method, `ThemeOwner`'s `get_theme_item_in_types` is called, which is supposed to go up the theme type hierarchy and get the proper font.\r\n\r\nHowever, in this method, `Theme`'s `has_theme_item` is checked, and it returns true, when a type variation does not have it set, because it has a default font in the theme.\r\n\r\nShould I create a new method that verifies if a font is actually set in this theme type and use it in `get_theme_item_in_types`, instead of `has_theme_item`?\r\n\r\nThe same applies to font size.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569503052/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569510690","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101066#issuecomment-2569510690","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101066","id":2569510690,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZJ58i","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T16:35:22Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T16:36:46Z","body":"> However, in this method, Theme's has_theme_item is checked, and it returns true, when a type variation does not have it set, because it has a default font in the theme.\r\n\r\nAs it should, if default font is set in the theme. But non-base theme should not have default values set (and this is likely the issue).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569510690/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569524379","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101066#issuecomment-2569524379","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101066","id":2569524379,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZJ9Sb","user":{"login":"dagarsar","id":32908423,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTA4NDIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32908423?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar","html_url":"https://github.com/dagarsar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T16:46:01Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T16:46:01Z","body":"> > However, in this method, Theme's has_theme_item is checked, and it returns true, when a type variation does not have it set, because it has a default font in the theme.\r\n> \r\n> As it should, if default font is set in the theme. But non-base theme should not have default values set (and this is likely the issue).\r\n\r\nWhen you say \"non-base theme\", are you referring to custom themes?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569524379/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569528772","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101066#issuecomment-2569528772","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101066","id":2569528772,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZJ-XE","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T16:49:36Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T16:49:36Z","body":"> But non-base theme should not have default values set (and this is likely the issue).\r\n\r\nI guess this is wrong, since variation is not a separate theme, and custom theme can have default font set. So it should check for defaults when checking base type, but should not when looking for variation.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569528772/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569543875","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101066#issuecomment-2569543875","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101066","id":2569543875,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZKCDD","user":{"login":"dagarsar","id":32908423,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTA4NDIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32908423?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar","html_url":"https://github.com/dagarsar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T17:00:44Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T17:00:44Z","body":"> > But non-base theme should not have default values set (and this is likely the issue).\r\n> \r\n> I guess this is wrong, since variation is not a separate theme, and custom theme can have default font set. So it should check for defaults when checking base type, but should not when looking for variation.\r\n\r\nBase type meaning Control theme type?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569543875/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569550044","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101066#issuecomment-2569550044","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101066","id":2569550044,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZKDjc","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T17:05:27Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T17:05:27Z","body":"> Base type meaning Control theme type?\r\n\r\nYes, non variation one. Simething like:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/scene/resources/theme.cpp b/scene/resources/theme.cpp\r\nindex b4f0f1834d..5b061a276b 100644\r\n--- a/scene/resources/theme.cpp\r\n+++ b/scene/resources/theme.cpp\r\n@@ -923,9 +923,17 @@ bool Theme::has_theme_item(DataType p_data_type, const StringName &p_name, const\r\n \t\tcase DATA_TYPE_CONSTANT:\r\n \t\t\treturn has_constant(p_name, p_theme_type);\r\n \t\tcase DATA_TYPE_FONT:\r\n-\t\t\treturn has_font(p_name, p_theme_type);\r\n+\t\t\tif (!variation_map.has(p_theme_type)) {\r\n+\t\t\t\treturn has_font(p_name, p_theme_type);\r\n+\t\t\t} else {\r\n+\t\t\t\treturn has_font_no_default(p_name, p_theme_type);\r\n+\t\t\t}\r\n \t\tcase DATA_TYPE_FONT_SIZE:\r\n-\t\t\treturn has_font_size(p_name, p_theme_type);\r\n+\t\t\tif (!variation_map.has(p_theme_type)) {\r\n+\t\t\t\treturn has_font_size(p_name, p_theme_type);\r\n+\t\t\t} else {\r\n+\t\t\t\treturn has_font_size_no_default(p_name, p_theme_type);\r\n+\t\t\t}\r\n \t\tcase DATA_TYPE_ICON:\r\n \t\t\treturn has_icon(p_name, p_theme_type);\r\n \t\tcase DATA_TYPE_STYLEBOX:\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569550044/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573868415","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101066#issuecomment-2573868415","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101066","id":2573868415,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zah1_","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025